sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Employee
  participant P as BI portal
  participant C as Amazon Cognito
  participant M as Microsoft Entra ID
  participant B as Engine (backend)
  participant PB as Power BI
  U->>P: Click "Sign in"
  P->>C: Redirect to the sign-in page
  C->>M: Authenticate with the corporate account
  M-->>C: Identity verified (e-mail, name)
  C-->>P: Temporary access token
  P->>B: Request the user's menu (with the token)
  B->>C: Verify the token and the account
  B-->>P: Menu according to audiences
  U->>P: Open a report
  P->>B: Request the report address
  B->>PB: Request / renew the embed token
  PB-->>B: Valid token
  B-->>P: Address + token + role filters
  P-->>U: Show the embedded report
